    "0% keeps positions; 100% applies full smoothing. The last point also controls larger variations. Where the local surface cannot be estimated, adaptive curves keep the original positions; uniform curves still apply. A larger neighborhood radius may help. Outlier removal and color denoising are independent. Noise can also cause variation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0% keeps positions; 100% applies full smoothing. The last point also controls larger variations. Where the local surface cannot be estimated, adaptive curves keep the original positions; uniform curves still apply. A larger neighborhood radius may help. Outlier removal and color denoising are independent. Noise can also cause variation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0% 保留原位置，100% 使用完整平滑结果。右端控制点也作用于超出范围的起伏。无法估计局部表面时，自适应曲线保留原位置，统一强度曲线仍会生效，可尝试增大评估半径。删点与颜色去噪另行生效；噪声也可能产生起伏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A higher SOR threshold removes fewer outliers. Points that move farther than the radial shift limit are removed, rather than limited to that distance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A higher SOR threshold removes fewer outliers. Points that move farther than the radial shift limit are removed, rather than limited to that distance."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SOR 标准差倍数越大，删除的孤立点越少。径向移动超过门限的点会被删除，而不是将移动距离截断为门限值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Absolute depth data is required for a scan in meters.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Absolute depth data is required for a scan in meters."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要绝对深度数据才能生成以米为单位的扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adaptive Smoothing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
