    "Each successful scan is automatically saved as an original point cloud. Filtering never overwrites it. Scan History stays on this device and records are not automatically removed. Deleting the app removes these records, so export any models you want to keep.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each successful scan is automatically saved as an original point cloud. Filtering never overwrites it. Scan History stays on this device and records are not automatically removed. Deleting the app removes these records, so export any models you want to keep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描成功后自动保存一份原始点云，滤波不会覆盖它。历史仅存于本机，不自动淘汰；删除 App 会移除这些记录，请主动导出需要长期保留的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
