    "For finer detail, reduce grid spacing, bilateral passes, or radius difference σ. Turn off median filtering for less smoothing. Grid fusion can still move points unless the smoothing curve keeps them in place.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For finer detail, reduce grid spacing, bilateral passes, or radius difference σ. Turn off median filtering for less smoothing. Grid fusion can still move points unless the smoothing curve keeps them in place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留细节可先减小网格间距、双边次数和半径差 σ。关闭中值滤波可减少平滑；除非曲线设置为保留原位置，网格融合仍可能移动点。"
