    "The camera is used only after you tap Start Scan. Camera images, TrueDepth depth data, and head pose are processed on your device to build the model. FaceScan does not identify you or record the original camera footage. Imported PLY files are read and displayed locally without changing the source file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera is used only after you tap Start Scan. Camera images, TrueDepth depth data, and head pose are processed on your device to build the model. FaceScan does not identify you or record the original camera footage. Imported PLY files are read and displayed locally without changing the source file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击开始扫描后才使用相机。画面、原深感深度与头部姿态仅在本机重建模型，不用于识别身份，不录制原始画面。打开的 PLY 仅在本机读取与展示，不改写源文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cylindrical grid is too large. Check the units, face-local coordinates, and filter settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cylindrical grid is too large. Check the units, face-local coordinates, and filter settings."
