    "When you export a model, you choose where to save it in the system file picker. If you choose iCloud or another file service, that service handles the file. Withdrawing consent stops capture and clears the current model, all scan history on this device, and temporary files. Files you have already exported are not deleted automatically. You can delete them separately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you export a model, you choose where to save it in the system file picker. If you choose iCloud or another file service, that service handles the file. Withdrawing consent stops capture and clears the current model, all scan history on this device, and temporary files. Files you have already exported are not deleted automatically. You can delete them separately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主动导出时，由你通过系统面板选择保存位置；若选择 iCloud 或其他文件服务，由所选服务处理。撤回同意会停止采集并清除当前模型、全部本机扫描历史与临时文件，已主动导出的文件需自行删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdraw Consent & Clear History": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Withdraw Consent & Clear History"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤回同意并清除扫描历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
